  "_comment": "Interview knowledge the DV-110 field_config cannot express. Twelve of the groups are the same three-way judge's ruling (not requested / denied until the hearing / granted), one per order type - the field_config records them as loose checkboxes, so each needs naming. Also: the case number repeats on all nine pages, and several conditionals name gates that do not exist as fields.",
